So you can do something like:

``` js
// with an instantsearch instance:
var search = instantsearch(....);
window.location.href = '.../' + search.createURL({facetsRefinements: {category: 'Home'}});

// or by just calling the static method:
window.location.href = '...#' + instantsearch.createQueryString({facetsRefinements: {category: 'Home'}});
```
